# 8. Onion Architecture

Similar to Clean Architecture.

```text
Infrastructure
      ↓
Application Services
      ↓
Domain Services
      ↓
Entities
```

The domain is at the center.

### Difference from Clean Architecture

They share the same fundamental idea:

> Keep business logic independent from infrastructure/frameworks.

The terminology and organization differ more than the fundamental architectural principle.

