SQL Server

        ↓ Events

Read Model
ElasticSearch / Redis / MongoDB
```

### Don't use CQRS everywhere.

Use it when:

* Read/write models differ significantly
* Complex business workflows
* High read scale
* Event-driven architecture
* Auditability requirements

